Both themes are dark whatever the phone is set to, so the colour scheme behind
the first frame is the dark one too. Before the app has painted its theme, the
package's own palette is what the splash and the frame around it are drawn in,
and on a phone set to light it would be the light one, a white flash before
every launch.

--- a/vendor/nativephp/mobile/resources/androidstudio/app/src/main/java/com/nativephp/mobile/ui/MainActivity.kt
